<title>India: Kashmir, Manipur and the Maoist belt: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/india/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-india-2026-11-01T16:53:09.761Z</guid>
<pubDate>Sun, 01 Nov 2026 16:53:09 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Kuki volunteers were shot dead and other Kuki men were found in gunny bags after attacks by rival groups, prompting rallies demanding the SoO agreement’s abrogation and the return of displaced families. Security forces recovered arms, explosives and Maoist communication equipment from a forest dump in Kanker, while a union minister said the Maoism-free state is becoming a tourism and investment hub. A convoy of the Darbar Move crossed Ramban under tight security and a road accident in Reasi killed one person and injured two. 437 battle-related deaths were recorded in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Hindu&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;India Today&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMirgFBVV95cUxNR1lmS2VkdmtWaTJPSEJnM0ItWXo4VjRfMDZIVkxLdGhsZ2RiNXItNHh6UnJOSXdNWlVLS1FXNm9HVms2Z25hZEZwYWdnRDdQZDRYV054VDNTVW1lRmVjR3o2QktVV3ZZQ1JoWHpLWVhkY2RsTF9zdmlCSkduampUS3E5b0RDSGZrWmkyNFVVWjc2UlVXaGI5WUFTNlh6Ry1OOXNxWGhOYzlKb21pZ3c?oc=5&quot;&gt;Deccan Herald&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;www.nationpathindia.com&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;ThePrint&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMihwFBVV95cUxOOGtIa1JnVURsTXRJNU1NVTk4cG5MVEF4aThZVURZSGYyV3ViVm44eE53YS0zaTNReGJ5dWJaN0J2aHlrRWJXeUJwandiZWRDUnNsTEVIVUhRSkZRN0NYV1RqdGlZUGVaNXdVX0JNV3NSb3VKRjU2NTAweVhUbTFzRl9QeVJZQ2M?oc=5&quot;&gt;Kashmir Life&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;India Today NE&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Organiser&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Deccan Chronicle&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiuAFBVV95cUxQTTJfUTRWbnV0bzh4Y